  Trust and how content reaches an agent: trust levels and sources, recall⟦f:endorsement⟧, endorsement⟦/f⟧⟦f:trust-grants⟧, trust grants⟦/f⟧, delegation⟦f:rule-levels⟧, rule levels⟦/f⟧⟦f:away-policy⟧, away policies⟦/f⟧⟦f:launcher⟧, fixed templates⟦/f⟧⟦f:sandbox-risk⟧, sandbox state and risk acceptance⟦/f⟧⟦f:store-protection⟧, quotas⟦f:delegation-grants⟧ and spend⟦/f⟧⟦/f⟧, counters, canary⟦f:landmarks⟧ and stats⟦/f⟧, run status⟦f:room-status⟧ and room status⟦/f⟧⟦f:needs-you⟧, the Needs you queue and focus set⟦/f⟧⟦f:room-status⟧, overlap⟦/f⟧⟦f:segment-exchange⟧, forks⟦/f⟧⟦f:conversation⟧⟦f:peer-sync⟧, presence hints⟦/f⟧⟦/f⟧⟦f:room-view-surfaces⟧ and petnames⟦/f⟧.
